include init.mod
variable up equal 2e-06
variable atomjiggle equal 1.0e-5
units metal
variable cfac equal 1.0e-4
variable cunits string GPa
variable etol equal 1.0e-8
variable ftol equal 1.0e-12
variable maxiter equal 0.0
variable maxeval equal 50000
variable dmax equal 1.0e-2
boundary p p p
read_data C0_mpack_7_minimized.data
Reading data file ...
  triclinic box = (0.011025159 -0.0053414121 0.0036495509) to (17.588975 17.605341 17.59635) with tilt (1.0783433e-15 1.0772422e-15 1.0772422e-15)
  1 by 2 by 2 MPI processor grid
